  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Naussilus.Core::Naussilus.Core.VisualNovels.EventDatas.DialogueDatas.Answers.FinalAnswerData
  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Et bien Pam si tu pense que c\u2019est un danger
    pour l\u2019\xE9quipage, c\u2019est ton r\xF4le d'\xE9viter les infections"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 668c08530be223b44883e3880f11ee48, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Je vois\u2026J'esp\xE9rais que le mousse pourrait au moins s\u2019occuper
      de \xE7a, mais je vais le faire."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "D\xE9sol\xE9\u2026Je peux t'aider."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 668c08530be223b44883e3880f11ee48, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Pas la peine, tu ne ferais qu\u2019\xEAtre dans mes pattes."
